OL,3,GNEWSAWoman partially loses sight after
OL,4,Aeye issue missed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former contestant on BBC series
OL,7,FDragon's Den said she lost part of her
OL,8,Fsight after doctors failed to
OL,9,Finvestigate her symptoms.
OL,11,FNoora Lewis' vision is impaired in her
OL,12,Fleft eye after she developed giant cell
OL,13,Farteritis, a rare condition which can
OL,14,Fcause permanent sight loss if not
OL,15,Ftreated urgently, and about which she
OL,16,Fis now raising awareness.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
