OL,3,GNEWSAWoman partially loses sight after
OL,4,Aeye issue missed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham Midland Eye Centre at City
OL,7,FHospital failed to diagnose the
OL,8,Fcondition and did not give her a biopsy
OL,9,For the full steroid treatment needed.
OL,10,FSeven weeks later she lost 50% of
OL,11,Fvision in her eye.
OL,13,FSandwell and West Birmingham NHS Trust
OL,14,Fhas admitted liability adding that it
OL,15,Fwas sorry for the failings in her care.
